Protocol comparison reference:
  bougou/go-ipmi (Apache License 2.0)
  https://github.com/bougou/go-ipmi
  Reviewed commit: d4fb9c6923cb22f7e3c982590e57f1f2c3b58ce6

The RMCP+ packet layouts target the IPMI 2.0 specification and were reviewed
against this reference implementation. No go-ipmi source files are distributed in this
repository. go-ipmi is not a runtime dependency; no affiliation is implied.

协议对照参考为 Apache-2.0 许可的 bougou/go-ipmi。
本仓库不分发其源文件，也不将其作为运行时依赖；不表示关联或背书。

Runtime dependencies / 运行时依赖:
  OpenSSL 3 libcrypto, Apache License 2.0: https://www.openssl.org/
  moonbitlang/async, Apache License 2.0: https://github.com/moonbitlang/async
  OpenSSL is linked as an installed system library, not vendored.
  OpenSSL 通过已安装的系统库链接，本仓库不内置其源码。

Optional validation tool / 可选验证工具:
  ipmitool: https://github.com/ipmitool/ipmitool
  Invoked as an independently installed client to cross-check the synthetic BMC.
  No ipmitool source files are distributed here; it is not a runtime dependency.
  使用独立安装的客户端交叉检查合成 BMC，不分发其源码，也不是运行时依赖。
